          "message": {
            "text": "`strip_prefix(\"SKU-\").unwrap().parse().unwrap()` in `insert_order` panics on any SKU without the `SKU-` prefix or with a non-numeric suffix. `order.items[0]` also panics when the order has no items. The function should return an error instead."
          },
          "ruleId": "panic-unwrap"
        },
